Template: dich/configure-official-source
Type: boolean
Default: true
Description: Configure Dich to use this system's official archive?
 Dich can create a trusted source policy for the official Debian or Ubuntu
 archive when this system is Debian 12/13 or Ubuntu 22.04/24.04 on amd64.
 The installed distribution archive keyring and pinned signing fingerprints
 are required. No third-party source will be enabled.
 .
 If you answer no, Dich will install without a source configuration. You can
 run "dich setup" later to create the supported default, or configure sources
 manually. Existing Dich configuration is never overwritten.
